              <profiles>
                <profile id="8054-9d2f-587f-4457" name="••Give in to Your Anger" hidden="false" typeId="76e4-5331-b635-524f" typeName="1.0 Command Cards">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Commander" typeId="c37c-423d-ec0a-fdf9">Emperor Palpatine</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Orders" typeId="0645-af6e-93d9-92c1">Emperor Palpatine</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="957b-dc58-3195-2a96">Before an opponent would activate their first unit, you may choose an enemy trooper unit. If you do, your opponent must activate that unit instead. Assign it an order token from its order pool unless it has a faceup order token. At the end of that unit&apos;s activation, if it did not perform an attack, it gains 4 suppression tokens.</characteristic>
